stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    [*] --> idle

    idle --> awaiting_approval: request_approval
    awaiting_approval --> idle: approve / reject
    awaiting_approval --> awaiting_approval: new request (busy)

    idle --> [*]

    classDef idleStyle fill:#059669,stroke:#064e3b,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff,font-weight:bold
    classDef waitStyle fill:#d97706,stroke:#78350f,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff,font-weight:bold

    class idle idleStyle
    class awaiting_approval waitStyle
